OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRemaining changeable over the next few
OL,7,Fdays, with spells of rain or showers
OL,8,Fat times, and feeling increasingly
OL,9,Ffresh. Turning windy as spells of rain
OL,10,Fmove through.
